                                <div id="generalTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                    data-bs-parent="#accordionGeneral">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        This program uniquely combines core data analytics skills with Generative AI and
                                        Agentic AI, enabling learners to work with real-world datasets, intelligent
                                        automation, and modern AI-driven decision systems. It focuses on practical,
                                        job-ready skills with guided projects and hands-on learning.
